% report, and the standards entries are carried unchanged from
% funding/auto-fund/*/packet/references.bib (v4.8.0).  Every other entry is new
% here, and its url was taken from the publishing organization's own page.
%
% CONVENTION.  Every entry that has a digital object identifier carries BOTH a
% doi field and a url field pointing at https://doi.org/<doi>, so unsrturl prints
% the identifier as text with a clickable target.  Every entry without an
% identifier carries a url that resolves to the document itself.  No entry
% carries a pages field, so no en dash can reach the printed list.
%
% STYLE.  sections/sec-06 asks for unsrturl, which prints doi and url fields;
% plain unsrt prints neither.
% ============================================================

